Cell["\<\
V has device-contact rows and lead-layer columns; the result acts on the \
device-contact space.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->720847356,ExpressionUUID->"4bdcf7be-ff95-1c4f-990f-47d7c3b3a66d"],

Cell["\<\
The ordinary result is V . SurfaceGreen[...] . ConjugateTranspose[V]. \
Explicit upper and reverse couplings support energy-dependent nonorthogonal \
transformations.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->727858600,ExpressionUUID->"0a436156-ca11-6b48-9eaf-7efa7867e2e4"],

Cell["\<\
The current implementation returns a zero sparse matrix when Norm[V, \
\"Frobenius\"] < Im[z]. Use a sufficiently small positive broadening relative \
to the coupling.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->786290610,ExpressionUUID->"ed2719dc-e47d-da4e-bb3c-e5fe0db73ac4"]
}, Closed]],

